Hildebrandt is a dragon who runs the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]]. The company's vault on the top floor of [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/Hallia/Hildebrandt Tower|Hildebrandt Tower]] holds the dragon's hoard, gold in heaped piles.
